  {"subject": "English", "year": 2621, "question": "In the sentence 'The two leaders reached an amicable settlement', the word 'amicable' means ___.", "options": ["hostile", "friendly", "forced", "delayed"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "'Amicable' means done in a friendly, agreeable manner."},

